onesparse (1.0.0-1PGSTY) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Package the official upstream v1.0.0 release for PostgreSQL 18.
  * Keep the system GraphBLAS/LAGraph patch applied during setup.
  * Note that the upstream release tag is v1.0.0 while the extension control
    version shipped inside the release is 0.1.0.

